<h1>{{ terms.technical_design_solution }}</h1>
<h2>Pipeline design</h2>
<ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename="technical_design_solution.png" /></ac:image>
<p>An orchestrator extracts each source into {{ layers.raw }}, transforms into
{{ layers.curated }} (applying the data quality rules from the
{{ terms.data_design_solution }}), then publishes {{ layers.presentation }}.</p>
<h2>Orchestration</h2>
<p>Daily schedule, source extracts by 3am, curated transform by 4:30am, presentation
publish by 6am local time. Failed runs retry twice with a 15-minute backoff before alerting.</p>
<h2>Environments</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>dev:</strong> sample data, manual trigger only</li>
<li><strong>test:</strong> full dummy volumes, nightly scheduled run</li>
<li><strong>prod:</strong> full volumes, nightly scheduled run, alerting enabled</li>
</ul>
<h2>Deployment</h2>
<p>Promoted dev to test to prod via the same orchestration config, parameterised by
environment; no environment-specific code.</p>
